<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus t-bill yield drops to 6.05 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus t-bill yield drops to 6.05 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus central bank said the average yield at a reverse repo auction of nine-day treasury bills was 6.05 percent, down 10 basis points from the average yield on 14-day bills sold at the last auction held on September 25.</p>
<p>Commercial banks bids totalled 14.5 million pounds for the 10.0 million pounds of bills on offer. -- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
